## What this website collects

**Analytics — only if you accept.** We use Google Analytics 4 to understand how the site is used: which pages are read, which language, roughly where visitors are, and which "Book now" buttons are clicked. Analytics storage is switched **off by default**. Nothing is stored on your device until you press *Accept* in the cookie banner. If you decline, Google receives a signal with no identifiers and no cookie is written.

**Booking.** Clicking any *Book now* button opens the Mews booking engine. Everything you type there — your name, contact details and payment information — is collected and processed by Mews, not by this website. Dates and guest numbers chosen in the search bar are passed to Mews in the page address; they identify nobody.

**Hosting and security.** The site runs on Cloudflare, which sets a short-lived cookie to distinguish visitors from bots.

**Fonts.** Typefaces load from Google Fonts, which means Google receives your IP address when a page opens.

## Cookies and similar storage

| Name | Set by | Purpose | Requires consent |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `_ga`, `_ga_*` | Google Analytics | Distinguishes visitors, measures usage | Yes |
| `paradis-consent` | This website | Remembers your cookie choice | No — strictly necessary |
| `paradis-promo-seen` | This website | Stops the offers pop-up reappearing in one visit | No — strictly necessary |
| `__cf_bm` | Cloudflare | Bot detection | No — strictly necessary |
| `__AntiforgeryToken` | Mews | Security token for the booking engine | No — strictly necessary |

## Your choices

The cookie banner appears on your first visit. You can change your mind at any time using **Cookie settings** at the foot of any page. Declining leaves analytics switched off; the site works normally either way.

## Your rights

Under the GDPR you may request access to your personal data, correction, deletion, restriction, or portability, and you may object to processing. You may also complain to the Dutch data protection authority, the Autoriteit Persoonsgegevens.

